    "text": "Figure 4.4, 'α sweeps for selected datasets': normalized cumulative reward (ALG/OPT) on y (0.66-1.02) against α on x (0.1-1.0) for datasets ds 19, 46, 16, 67, 58, 55, each with a shaded confidence band. ds 55 is flat near 0.996; ds 19 and ds 46 decrease with α (about 0.79 to 0.72 and 0.735 to 0.70); the others are nearly flat between 0.84 and 0.95.",
